{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2000_p", "source_sha256": "4addde0bf670085ccde76da55c0c6126978581642b6998570d424a55dca8eb06", "ja": "ひとつ、確認させてください。千鶴さんはどうして、\nそんなに今回の公演を盛り上げたいんですか？", "zh": "请让我先确认一点。\n千鹤为什么这么热切想办好这次的公演呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2001_038chz", "source_sha256": "6211b6984c3a9a69302d6ff606a77bc8d2173ce9ea115ada7389892522b3b2c7", "ja": "え？　ど、どうしてって……\n理由は、先ほど申し上げたとおりで……。", "zh": "咦？你、你问本小姐为什么……\n理由就如同刚才陈述的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2002_p", "source_sha256": "c55881b73b84127c5a60d30101ebfff10c9635f5baec5600edd96bd9c15ce646", "ja": "そうですか？　俺には、今の千鶴さんは\nなんだか少し焦っているように見えました。", "zh": "是这样吗？\n从我看来，千鹤好像有点急躁了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2003_038chz", "source_sha256": "b9dc9bac9cb09b02027725b553d2d29990f934c2d1b364bd99a8576a13fc99eb", "ja": "そ、それは……。", "zh": "这、这个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2004_p", "source_sha256": "cc6cce3ffc04058196cad34ffe45fc64ab3519d54d282e70b5da7794dc4d3299", "ja": "ただ闇雲に走るのではなく、ゴールを決めて\n走りましょう。そうでないと、潰れてしまいますよ。", "zh": "不要只是盲目地横冲直撞，\n决定好终点再去奔跑吧，不然你会先累倒的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2006_038chz", "source_sha256": "8cf945d4a92bee62d6adb23b666d328268e6e92dba8f52e85ab3d566dd7a8601", "ja": "たしかに、貴方のおっしゃる通りですわ。\nわたくしは、焦っています。", "zh": "的确，正如你所说。\n是本小姐太急躁了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2007_038chz", "source_sha256": "74fb7cdd0c51873b246828761a290ecc1b55ac5d71029f693c484a9e9fdbd0ce", "ja": "けど、こうして歌織さんや風花にも、レッスンに\n付き合っていただいてますわ。それをムダには……。", "zh": "不过，歌织跟风花也都像现在这样，\n陪着本小姐一起训练，不能白费她们的苦心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2008_052kao", "source_sha256": "e8f9534416ac4bcadd572f1fffb67b9f579287fa92c231ca4b2aebebb1955b37", "ja": "私たちのことなら気にしないで、千鶴ちゃん。\n好きで一緒にレッスンしてるんだから！", "zh": "千鹤，你不用在意我们。\n我是自己主动想跟你一起训练的啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2009_038chz", "source_sha256": "67dae1e83cac28822c00d45da1f4215c5be912a259308881b519adf33d62e095", "ja": "歌織さん？", "zh": "歌织？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b4a0c780c94564e4127a4cb1fac80c6b18387b8ff77c722fd4081c56308c87a4", "ja": "そうだよ、千鶴ちゃん。それに私、言ったよね？\n私がセンターになった時に、返してねって。", "zh": "没错，千鹤。而且我之前也说过吧？\n等我当上Center的时候，你要再报答我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2011_041fuk", "source_sha256": "7272bd9d1947b5b9de243f285b92efe6a734f14ff91d76a4b42fac45cec92190", "ja": "だからそんなこと、気にしなくていいんだよ！\n大丈夫♪", "zh": "所以你根本不用介意这种小事！\n没问题的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2012_038chz", "source_sha256": "e945e1931f40085b5725562380d664b92e7da4febca9278aa6f1b9642f941aa4", "ja": "風花……あ、ありがとう。\nわたくし……。", "zh": "风花……谢、谢谢你。\n本小姐……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2013_p", "source_sha256": "3da9359866c446ad76f783b676dd8d10269e6b6b401adf68fa43c3d0ad086d5c", "ja": "もちろん、無理をしなくちゃいけない時もあります。\nでもそれは、今ではないと思います。", "zh": "当然也会有需要逼出自己潜力的时候，\n不过我想那并不是现在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2014_p", "source_sha256": "52424788e2255441d621e54311a53db66b246b5ea9c0af3e69a0774c2d937240", "ja": "千鶴さんのその熱意があれば、本番ではきっと、\n劇場を包み込むほどの輝きが放てるようになります！", "zh": "只要有千鹤的这份热情，等到正式开演时，\n一定能够绽放出笼罩整座剧场的光芒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2015_038chz", "source_sha256": "9c02f73446affed1aab59d05689b59efa3d04f9dccfe97ded6577ba71e17cbed", "ja": "{$P$}……わかりましたわ。", "zh": "{$P$}……好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2016_p", "source_sha256": "e5d9f4dfb4e8286505676a07df9fd39f44b8c094540806369b3428137a100be4", "ja": "（公演のセンターにとって、大切なこと……\n千鶴さんなら、きっとわかってくれるはずだ）", "zh": "（对公演的Center来说最重要的事……\n千鹤她一定能够理解的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
