{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2023_038chz", "source_sha256": "62cad669208fb90aa3dcc85f5c4ff6f2061a9610fceb72668f942daff3cbe387", "ja": "！　そ、それは……！", "zh": "呃！这、这个……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2024_025roc", "source_sha256": "742c470acaa99ea42399d0934c15a842977be09111384bdb39821b4669a7affd", "ja": "チヅル、安心してください！　ロコアミュレットを\n作ってきました。これでパーフェクトですよ♪", "zh": "千鹤，请你放心！ROCO做好Roco Amulet带过来了。\n这样一来就Perfect了喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2025_007ior", "source_sha256": "ba4d2bc3d866551f2f548a413a15c45708da59e3527c13e05b6a68e6e16fab73", "ja": "あら、すごいじゃない！　細かい模様が入ってる\nのね～。何かの儀式とかに使うの？", "zh": "哎呀，好厉害呢！上面的花纹真是细致～\n这是要用在什么仪式上的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2026_025roc", "source_sha256": "3154216318463f6b3d5564944095c55ba216cee003218459c1cc544f07ef5f68", "ja": "違います！　チヅルの公演が成功するように\nロコがいろいろ……つまり、お守りみたいなものです！", "zh": "不是的！这是为了让千鹤的公演成功，\nROCO做了很多……总之，是像护身符一样的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2027_038chz", "source_sha256": "710d241f99948a383a594ad650bf4f48c9c5330e026b564d2ed7b8ff5c87e869", "ja": "まあ……\nコロちゃんが、わたくしのために？", "zh": "哎呀……\nCORO为了本小姐特地做的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2028_025roc", "source_sha256": "1fa08c327890335db6e90cd56733b4b0908d52dd36f44bb2fc6835854c20a04b", "ja": "はい！　ニューエイジなアイコンとして\nワールドワイドのニューウェーブを意識した……。", "zh": "没错！作为New Age的Icon，\n考虑到Worldwide的New Wave……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2029_007ior", "source_sha256": "862efb005cc6b68276b2c5b830e304da8d8b30b96596bd8a5f7ab66f892b8017", "ja": "ち、ちょっと、その英語、どこの方言なの？\nなに言ってるか、ぜんぜんわからないわ！", "zh": "等、等一下，你说的英语是哪里的方言啊？\n我根本听不懂你在说什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2030_025roc", "source_sha256": "7663a316615b4d2699dfef8268dea5f9995a366ed34de6bee43e7b56e5a9caad", "ja": "イオリはアートに興味がなさすぎます！", "zh": "伊织对Art实在太不关心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2031_038chz", "source_sha256": "3fb4509858d76d84ed7165684ed42243d1c3a0f721697e6b71c4792a09a93e73", "ja": "ふふ……感謝いたしますわ、コロちゃん！", "zh": "呵呵……非常感谢你，CORO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2032_025roc", "source_sha256": "0210c2ea21ae4e11883ca7b514b614a9c4e8c08fc3b00f75820feef21c9d95cf", "ja": "これくらいウェルカムですよ。\nあと、コロじゃなくてロコです！", "zh": "不过一点小事，Welcome喔。\n还有，ROCO不叫CORO，是ROCO！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2033_038chz", "source_sha256": "a17e7644ed6874029b877daeaf299faed83993b8edb0e7a9fbcfe64c4d500b95", "ja": "{$P$}。わたくし、わかった気が\nしますわ。公演を盛り上げたい、本当の理由……。", "zh": "{$P$}，本小姐好像懂了。\n自己想要办好这次公演的真正理由……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2034_p", "source_sha256": "a0b430002e5aa99582516fbba15808e53160e5de0c3bcf7648b023616983a6a2", "ja": "本当の……どんな理由ですか？", "zh": "真正的理由……是什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2035_038chz", "source_sha256": "104af6a16812254f07fb5ebe6bf8051afcec6071d6c1ed279f3ca38e86a8b038", "ja": "はい。わたくしがアイドルとしてステージに\n立つことを応援し、励みに思ってくださる人がいます。", "zh": "嗯，有人愿意支持、鼓励本小姐\n以偶像的身分站上舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2036_038chz", "source_sha256": "54f40e6d4b0ae62a5ba64af5e81577b4258249bf5a8dbc6c858b9a1ccb841f3e", "ja": "それはファンのみなさま方や、劇場の仲間、\nそして{$P$}……。", "zh": "他们是粉丝，以及剧场的同伴，\n还有{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2037_038chz", "source_sha256": "716ab3f3dabe50df58d70018a752fad49e4ce749615322957bfc94bd5bdd92b6", "ja": "特別な見返りがなくとも、心を寄せ、わたくしの成長を\n見守ってくださる。その心に、報いるためにも……。", "zh": "就算没有什么特殊的回报，他们还是付出关心、\n守候着本小姐的成长，那么为了报答他们的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2038_038chz", "source_sha256": "5665e204955933910b87ed33e2e22a92ff6de4a7eccd1eb7421722c61d4e27c5", "ja": "わたくしが光り輝き、公演を盛り上げてみせること。\n……それがわたくしの望みであり、使命なのですわ！", "zh": "本小姐要绽放光彩，将公演办得热闹非凡。\n……这不仅是本小姐的心愿，也是使命！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2039_p", "source_sha256": "0cee02d542eb39242928a7b30e7bcb9926e0a23b5be3eb7f6d0b34330ed642d4", "ja": "わかりました。……その気持ちを忘れずに、\nセンターとして堂々と真ん中に立ってください！", "zh": "我知道了……请你别忘了这份心情，\n以Center的身分抬头挺胸站上中央的位置！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2040_038chz", "source_sha256": "f99c2f5a76bf9a063b1fadb1e7abbec73f4ffd214cbca06495db7c2982d1d916", "ja": "ええ、おまかせくださいまし！\n必ずや、ファンのみなさまを笑顔にしてみせますわ！", "zh": "嗯，请交给本小姐吧！\n本小姐一定会让粉丝们绽放出笑容的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2041_025roc", "source_sha256": "dcac80fbb1f168fcbb6dab59bdca173b14b8cfd8518023bc121a9a5f09f02886", "ja": "もちろん、ロコも手伝いますよ！\nたくさんレッスンしましたから、バッチリです♪", "zh": "ROCO当然也会帮忙喔！\n已经排练过很多次了，准备万全♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
