{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_028_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_028_2043_041fuk", "source_sha256": "549c799fd76da7de3ee644ab6d0cb4891ef33555c181125647ee3a407a769cd7", "ja": "ふふっ、そうだよね。\n私たちみんなで力をあわせて、がんばろうね♪", "zh": "呵呵，就是说啊。\n我们同心协力，一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
